# Official Print Standard (List Documents)

All **list-form** print outputs use **A4 Landscape** with **DOC-01 as Layout Master**.

Source: `src/config/titanListPrintStandard.js` · `src/components/print/titan-print.css` · `.titan-print-list`

Companion: `.cursor/rules/project-titan-print-engine-policy.mdc`

---

## Documents (Landscape + common layout)

DOC-01 HTL · DOC-02 DPR list · DOC-03 Inspection list · DOC-04 Certificate list · DOC-05 Outbound list · DOC-06 History list

**Same:** Header · Footer · Table style · QR position · document number system · Print Engine

**Only columns change** — layout stays identical.

---

## Typography (compact ERP)

- Base font ~**1–2pt smaller** than prior preview (12px table body vs 14px)
- Row height auto-adjusts with font · line-height ~1.32
- **No ellipsis** on wrap columns

---

## Margins

- Header and Footer **retained**
- Table body area **maximized** (8mm page padding · tighter header/table gaps)
- Goal: more rows per page without over-shrinking

---

## Engine

- `TITAN_LIST_PRINT_LINE_BUDGET` · group keep-together · wrap columns
- New list prints: copy DOC-01 pattern — change columns only

---

## Procedure

Preview → PM screenshot → approval → PDF → Workflow → Commit → Push → Beta

Non-list docs (거래명세서 · 성적서 양식 등): dedicated layout — still use Print Engine core.
